(Ord. No. 275, § II, 3-2-2009)

356:
Application for a solicitor's permit shall be made to the city clerk during hours posted by the city clerk on an application provided by the city which shall contain the following information:
(1) The solicitor's name, address and telephone number. If the solicitor is an affiliate or chapter of an organization having its principal office outside the city, the name, address and telephone number of the parent organization;
